# Who may use which topics (ADR-0104). Anything not granted is denied.

# Home Assistant reads everything it is offered and sends the commands.
user homeassistant
topic readwrite #

# ring-mqtt publishes its devices under ring/ and their discovery under
# homeassistant/, and reads homeassistant/status for Home Assistant's birth
# message. Nothing else.
user ring-mqtt
topic readwrite ring/#
topic readwrite homeassistant/#
